@startuml st3_teacher_api
' 状态图3：教师 AI API 配置生命周期
' 依据：server/src/teacher_api.c（save/toggle/load/metadata）、teacher_api_routes.c、
'       docs/teacher-api.md；每次保存 version+1 并写 teacher_ai_audit
skinparam shadowing false

state "未配置" as Unconfigured
state "已配置·启用" as Enabled
state "已配置·停用" as Disabled

[*] --> Unconfigured : 教师注册/登录即具备管理资格\n（无需运维授权）

Unconfigured --> Enabled : PUT /teacher/ai-api {api_key, model?}\n[守卫: valid_key ∧ valid_model ∧ 身份匹配]\n动作: AES-256-GCM 加密入库，version=1\n写审计 configure_or_enable

Unconfigured --> Unconfigured : PATCH（无配置）\n动作: 404 AI_API_NOT_CONFIGURED

Enabled --> Enabled : PUT 替换 Key/模型\n动作: version+1，重加密（新 nonce）\ncredentialScope 变更 → 旧对话追问 409
Enabled --> Disabled : PATCH {enabled:false}\n动作: 解密→重存，version+1，审计 disable\n学生新提交 → 403 AI_API_DISABLED
Disabled --> Enabled : PATCH {enabled:true}\n动作: 解密→重存，version+1，审计 configure_or_enable

Enabled --> [*] : （配置长期保留，无删除接口）
Disabled --> [*]

note right of Enabled
  GET 仅返回脱敏元数据
  （configured/enabled/provider/model/
  masked_key/version/updated_at）；
  student/admin 访问管理接口一律 403
end note

note bottom of Disabled
  停用不影响已受理任务：
  仍可 GET 查询 / DELETE 取消
end note
@enduml
